                                "sense_id": "f3495b7b-3175-3c60-8aa7-d90166bbbdf0",
                                "text": "\"Maintaining social distancing on trains and the Tube is a massive logistical exercise that requires planning, resources and the protection of staff managing the flows of passengers. [...]\""
